package my:d1-table;

/// The plugin *provides* `table` to components, so it belongs under `imports`.
///
/// Some plugins in this workspace declare the same thing under `exports`
/// (cf-d1, mail, feishu, telegram, wechat). Per `wash-runtime/src/wit.rs`,
/// `imports` are the interfaces a plugin offers a workload; this world follows
/// that, and the majority convention (crontab, event_monitor, task_queue).
world d1-table {
    import custom:d1-table/table@0.1.0;
}